<title>POLAND: Prochem plans PLN 650,000 for payout.</title>
<headline>Prochem plans PLN 650,000 for payout.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish engineering firm Prochem SA plans to earmark 650,000 zlotys of its net profit for dividend, 2.6 million zlotys for reserve capital and 50,000 for charity, the company said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said the proposal would be voted on May 24.</p>
